      8 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِلْتَأَمَ</span></b>  <i>It</i> (a wound, and a crack) <i>became
coalesced, consolidated, closed,</i> or <i>closed up:</i> (S:)
<i>it</i> (a hole, or rent,) <i>became repaired.</i> (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِلْتَأَمَا</span> <i>They</i> (two things) <i>agreed together,</i> or <i>became consistent.</i> (S, Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِلْتَأَمَ</span> <i>It drew,
and stuck, together; coalesced;</i> or <i>consolidated.</i>
(Mgh.)

